1
00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:48,580
Northern Lights of Christmas is a drama, romance, tv
movie film directed by Jonathan Wright.

2
00:05:25,161 --> 00:05:31,161
Zoey Hathaway has been working towards her lifelong goal of being a pilot for years, but everything is thrown off-course
when she unexpectedly inherits a reindeer farm, along with the dangerously handsome ranch hand Alec Wynn.

3
00:08:07,741 --> 00:08:13,741
Now buried in taking care of reindeer and all the Christmas responsibilities, Zoey thinks life has delivered her a
strange and cumbersome blow, and she isn’t sure about Alec, who has his own ideas how best to run things.

4
00:10:50,322 --> 00:10:56,322
Alec, who has never had many people have faith in him, opens up when Zoey invests
trust in him, and the two find themselves falling for each other.

5
00:13:32,903 --> 00:13:38,903
Could they both find happiness in the most unlikely of
circumstances right before Christmas?

6
